@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = owned-test-account@example.test
@resetToken = REPLACE_FROM_OWN_TEST_MAIL

### 가입 여부와 무관한 빈 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### 확인은 소비하지 않아요
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{resetToken}}" }

### 본인 테스트 계정에서만 호출해요. 성공204 뒤 기존 refresh는 거부돼요.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{resetToken}}", "newPassword": "LocalTestNew123" }
